ject_type>1</_project_type><_quantity is_null=\"1\" /><_reason>根据A级纪要优化前部线束和发动机线束：\r\n1.前驱MCU和后驱MCU由共用一颗保险，更改为前、后两个MCU的电源KL30和KL15分开，通过单独保险供电；\r\n2.将前部线束对接发动机线束的ECAN线由左前侧插头FB004-EN913，移到右后侧对接插头FB974-EN974，避免碰撞时将ECAN撞断。\r\n下此PAA：\r\n1.支持线束供应商生成更改后的物料进行试装；\r\n2.试装无问题后，支持物流按需拉动量产安波福/柳州双飞物料装车；\r\n\r\n</_reason><_requester_department>技术中心_电子电器工程</_requester_department><_requester_phone></_requester_phone><_requester_smt>EEN 电气工程科</_requester_smt><_resp_unit>N/A</_resp_unit><_rework_place>N/A</_rework_place><_spcl_instr>新物料悬挂标识</_spcl_instr><_stakeholder_buy_in>N/A</_stakeholder_buy_in><_stock_disp>6</_stock_disp><_submit_date>2026-06-17T13:42:33</_submit_date><_support_ewo_concession>1</_support_ewo_concession><_validation_statement>N/A</_validation_statement><_vehicles>F710S</_vehicles><created_by_id keyed_name=\"蒙韬(m22200286)\" type=\"User\">7A0DD5AD15F046DA8A1DC20557FCAF94</created_by_id><created_on>2026-06-17T11:18:49</created_on><css is_null=\"1\" /><current_state name=\"DRAFT1\" keyed_name=\"DRAFT1\" type=\"Life Cycle State\">E161CA1786624606A337CE2D30E5E801</current_state><effective_date is_null=\"1\" /><generation>1</generation><id keyed_name=\"PAA011539\" type=\"PAA_O\">17E203528D2442DB8D97CD73678F0539</id><is_current>1</is_current><keyed_name>PAA011539</keyed_name><locked_by_id is_null=\"1\" /><major_rev>A</major_rev><modified_by_id keyed_name=\"蒙韬(m22200286)\" type=\"User\">7A0DD5AD15F046DA8A1DC20557FCAF94</modified_by_id><modified_on>2026-06-17T13:42:34</modified_on><new_version>1</new_version><release_date is_null=\"1\" /><state>DRAFT1</state><_no>PAA011539</_no></Item><Item type=\"PAA_O\" typeId=\"AB78E8D480754234925C19962AD62A4D\" id=\"330059EB707E49488F1B5BB8A1FD9CCB\" page=\"1\"><_affect_certificate>0</_affect_certificate><_affect_vehicle_photo>0</_affect_vehicle_photo><_area>BJ-GA-00</_area><_auth_type>1</_auth_type><_base>BJ</_base><_change_description>不涉及公告参数变更</_change_description><_charge_to>N/A</_charge_to><_days>60</_days><_days_or_qty>0</_days_or_qty><_effect_consistency>0</_effect_consistency><_emis_related>0</_emis_related><_est_cmpl_date is_null=\"1\" /><_est_cost>N/A</_est_cost><_ewo_no>EWO-038215、EWO-045301、EWO-046022、EWO-046462、EWO-045917、EWO-046915、EWO-047748</_ewo_no><_exted_reason>N/A</_exted_reason><_gacsn></_gacsn><_idle_days>4</_idle_days><_issue_date is_null=\"1\" /><_key_part>0</_key_part><_license_tag>0</_license_tag><_mass_impact>0</_mass_impact><_model_year>2026</_model_year><_mtl_rq_date>2026-06-18T00:00:00</_mtl_rq_date><_pe_tdc keyed_name=\"王凯(w22306288)\" type=\"User\">C8DF01FE2AB24010A4947A70FB14BBDE</_pe_tdc><_pe_tdc_department>技术中心_智驾网联</_pe_tdc_department><_pe_tdc_name>王凯(w22306288)</_pe_tdc_name><_pe_tdc_phone>18396786629</_pe_tdc_phone><_pe_tdc_smt>IDCHS 智驾网联硬件科</_pe_tdc_smt><_pp_comments></_pp_comments><_project_type>1</_project_type><_quantity is_null=\"1\" /><_reason>F610S项目网联语音通信系统总成（27125599/27135129）已完成OTS有条件认可（SOC：F610S061QLC0141043；MCU： F610S061QLA0140015），申请PAA使用此版软件（SOC：F610S061QLC0141043；MCU： F610S061QLA0140015）、硬件V1.1.1对LV0 (27125599)、LV1&amp;LV2（27135129）物料进行刷新及生产。\r\n授权如下：\r\n1、授权使用以上版本及零件号对网联语音通信系统总成进行手刷件PTR试装;\r\n2、授权东莞市勤领汽车电子有限公司使用以上版本及零件号对网联语音通信系统总成刷机并挂PTR标识，由宝骏基地拉动PTR试装。\r\n3、授权宝骏物流区域，接收此批次网联语音通信系统总成的手刷件PTR物料。\r\n4、授权宝骏总装车间，使用此批次网联语音通信系统总成的物料进行手刷件PTR试装。\r\n5、授权东莞市勤领汽车电子有限公司在手刷件PTR试装通过后使用以上版本及零件号对库存物料进行软件刷新及后续物料生产。</_reason><_requester_department>技术中心_智驾网联</_requester_department><_requester_phone>18396786629</_requester_phone><_requester_smt>IDCHS 智驾网联硬件科</_requester_smt><_resp_unit>N/A</_resp_unit><_rework_place>N/A</_rework_place><_spcl_instr>授权东莞市勤领汽车电子有限公司，按照（SOC：F610S061QLC0141043；MCU： F610S061QLA0140015）软件导入网联语音通信系统总成（27125599/27135129）物料生产，具体如下：\r\n1、授权对现有库存物料软件刷新，刷新后需进行全功能点检，对返修后物料进行标识更新，见附件；\r\n2、零件总成和外包装箱贴绿豆标识（标签内含PAA编号），标签张贴位置及式样见附件；\r\n3、授权东莞市勤领汽车电子有限公司使用以上版本及零件号进行网联语音通信系统总成物料生产。</_spcl_instr><_stakeholder_buy_in>F610S网联语音通信系统总成已完成实车功能测试、台架测试、导航、路试、DV测试、总线诊断测试等，测试存在部分问题经过风险评估并在此版本冻结，5月7日已完成OTS有条件认可。</_stakeholder_buy_in><_stock_disp>1</_stock_disp><_submit_date>2026-06-17T11:29:03</_submit_date><_support_ewo_concession>1</_support_ewo_concession><_validation_statement>1、软件包信息（SOC：F610S061QLC0141043；MCU： F610S061QLA0140015；AVAS：F610S0AVAS10100000）\r\n2、U盘包校验值（SOC：a57af10245eb4c2822fa68849263225b；MCU：14621bdccb4c51c6f56688fc63a4df81；AVAS：45d4d3b0380ec606517551bd5286a44f）\r\n3、生产包校验值（SOC：7c7910164fceb2f56cabb98f8fb9c44d；MCU：dc14cbaed770104180a702ebfd4d34e0；AVAS：45d4d3b0380ec606517551bd5286a44f）</_validation_statement><_vehicles>F610S</_vehicles><created_by_id keyed_name=\"王凯(w22306288)\" type=\"User\">C8DF01FE2AB24010A4947A70FB14BBDE</created_by_id><created_on>2026-06-15T14:45:21</created_on><css is_null=\"1\" /><current_state name=\"OPEN\" keyed_name=\"OPEN\" type=\"Life Cycle State\">AF40FFD081B0427EA7AAE864C947A557</current_state><effective_date is_null=\"1\" /><generation>1</generation><id keyed_name=\"PAA011538\" type=\"PAA_O\">330059EB707E49488F1B5BB8A1FD9CCB</id><is_current>1</is_current><keyed_name>PAA011538</keyed_name><locked_by_id is_null=\"1\" /><major_rev>A</major_rev><modified_by_id keyed_name=\"王凯(w22306288)\" type=\"User\">C8DF01FE2AB24010A4947A70FB14BBDE</modified_by_id><modified_on>2026-06-17T14:06:44</modified_on><new_version>1</new_version><release_date is_null=\"1\" /><state>OPEN</state><_no>PAA011538</_no></Item><Item type=\"PAA_O\" typeId=\"AB78E8D480754234925C19962AD62A4D\" id=\"FEDDD09C1FCA4D24876A569A448424F0\" page=\"1\"><_affect_certificate>0</_affect_certificate><_affect_vehicle_photo>0</_affect_vehicle_photo><_area>HX-GA-00,QD-GA-00</_area><_auth_type>1</_auth_type><_base>QD,HX</_base><_change_description is_null=\"1\" /><_charge_to>N/A</_charge_to><_days>90</_days><_days_or_qty>0</_days_or_qty><_effect_consistency>0</_effect_consistency><_emis_related>0</_emis_related><_est_cmpl_date is_null=\"1\" /><_est_cost>N/A</_est_cost><_ewo_no></_ewo_no><_exted_reason is_null=\"1\" /><_gacsn></_gacsn><_idle_days>4</_idle_days><_issue_date is_null=\"1\" /><_key_part>0</_key_part><_license_tag>0<